  "writing_rules": [
    "Load this template before creating or structurally editing the world-event registry.",
    "Create stable event IDs and transition lifecycle fields; never replace a cold archetype with active state by copying it verbatim.",
    "Material outcomes remain authoritative in their referenced domain owners and receipts; this registry coordinates lifecycle and provenance without duplicating their mechanics.",
    "Visibility classification never grants knowledge. Record witnesses, audiences, knowledge records and delivery routes only after their own authorities support them.",
    "Reducer, reducer-version, transaction and receipt references are mandatory deterministic provenance.",
    "display_summary is non-authoritative rendering text and may never supply an outcome, consequence, visibility fact or mechanic.",
    "Do not add an unregistered field. A new field requires maintenance-time schema and template revision first.",
    "Canonical key order is a writing convention only; semantic validation does not depend on JSON object order."
  ]
